{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785993990792234001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"pale-altar-mote","assignee":"Joe Oakhart","author":"Joe Oakhart","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":5},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1783304014179907001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[{"link_uuid":"b7bd6905-e4dc-4e54-a7c2-e5d3d554de95","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"f112-6222-e236-4b09"}],"description":"## Reproduction Steps\n1. Push a v* tag (v0.7.0) → release.yml runs.\n2. Build + Publish to PyPI succeed.\n3. The `github_release` job fails in ~6s.\n\n## Expected vs Actual\n- **Expected:** the job creates the GitHub Release for the tag.\n- **Actual:** step fails with `failed to run git: fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git` (exit 1). GitHub Actions run 28763401143, job \"Create GitHub Release\".\n\n## Root cause\nThe `github_release` job only runs `actions/download-artifact` then `gh release …`. It never runs `actions/checkout`, and sets no `GH_REPO`, so the `gh` CLI has no repository context and tries to infer it from a local git repo that isn't there.\n\n## Fix\nSet `GH_REPO: ${{ github.repository }}` in the step env (lighter than a full checkout; `gh release create/view/edit/upload` and `--generate-notes` all work against the API with GH_REPO set). Introduced by change 314 (ticket f112-6222-e236-4b09).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `.github/workflows/release.yml` `github_release` step sets `GH_REPO: ${{ github.repository }}` (or checks out the repo) so `gh` has repo context.\n- [ ] The next tag-triggered release creates the GitHub Release automatically without the git-repository error.\n- [ ] v0.7.0 GitHub Release exists and is marked Latest (created as a one-off since PyPI 0.7.0 is immutable and the tag workflow cannot be safely re-run).","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"e9067eff-fa1a-4d68-993f-d851e722da38","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"8ed5-9c7d-cb86-42c8","ticket_type":"bug","title":"release.yml github_release job fails: gh needs repo context (not a git repository)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["28b9cbc7-5120-4e19-9a5e-4aa62e71ca85","b7bd6905-e4dc-4e54-a7c2-e5d3d554de95","e9067eff-fa1a-4d68-993f-d851e722da38","3ae301c9-e3d4-44b1-9442-364acd17ffc6","f336cdd5-1a78-4146-848a-4fd695af7147"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785993990792234001,"uuid":"8b0feb2c-f9e3-409d-8b2a-89c966285f2c"}